  "description": "Prefix sums for coding interviews: O(1) range sums, prefix plus hash map for subarray sum K, contiguous array, continuous subarray sum and Path Sum III, difference arrays (car pooling), 2D prefix and prefix XOR, with templates in Go, C++, Java and Python.",
  "hero": {
